# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day 13

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| postpone | 연기하다 | The meeting was postponed. |
| require | 요구하다 | The job requires experience. |
| available | 이용 가능한 | The room is available tomorrow. |
